<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank sells PLN 185 mln NBP-bills.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank sells PLN 185 mln NBP-bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 185 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 197 million, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the 273-day paper remained flat at 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
